  "method": "Actual Unity Play Mode BakeMesh. Orthographic 160×160 rays over a 0.40m square centred on the midpoint of the eye bones. A spring triangle must be more than 0.5mm in front of an eye triangle. All three vertices belong to the same measured chain or eye; each has an owner with greater than 0.30 weight. Counts describe projected geometry; opacity and intervening static hair are evaluated separately in the photographs. Lateral hair travel counts vertices more than 5mm beyond the opposite side of the eye-bone midsagittal plane.",
  "poses": "Neutral and head yaw +12° with Aa 65% use a 25° camera. Root movement uses a frontal camera at rest and frames 6, 12, 18, 24, 36, 90, and 150 of the fixed 60 Hz perturbation.",
